+Canonical source/twohelpers and complete packet now frozen for root port review. Integrate on41, register second helper claim-locally, execute canonical caches, freeze all graph-visible files before pipeline, keep live logs outside worktree. Do not erase the actual R1 failed crude theta condition or transfer exact-four trial identity to finite compression.
+
+## Integration checkpoint
+
+Child of corrected41 science062191e5a46c4c6924b505ca3124af26ffd9aecb, published PR8031. Root canonical review copied before graph freeze. Complete proofs, corrected generator convention, failed optional sufficient budget and all raw evidence preserved. Source and both helper bytes unchanged;40 finite abstract controls and22 actual R1 controls retain distinct scopes. BOTH graph and diagnostic packet helper dictionaries are explicitly checked by AST for the actual claim and R1 sibling. Expected19 affected ready claims against corrected main7887b4481feae2800c04c7c42ddac9554f2c2b9f. All graph-visible files freeze through validation; logs outside. Campaign report excluded until final delivery metadata. No full-unitary trial cost is identified with exact charged spectral minimum.
+
+## Completed root validation
+
+Root final port review and pipeline c2e688342131, strict lint and 19-claim readiness passed against 7887b4481feae2800c04c7c42ddac9554f2c2b9f. See FINAL_VALIDATION.md and the pre-cleanup receipts. Actual stdout caches are staged. Review publication is the next action; no science merge or audit verdict is performed.
+
+## Draft publication
+
+Draft PR8032 stacked on PR8031. Science67a35a27a958e6b6f37c1aec9fbe181ab1d52005; full validationc2e688342131 strict19ready passed against7887. Parent delivery metadata caught up with all canonical/cache/registry bytes unchanged. GitHub process_contracts SUCCESS, MERGEABLE/CLEAN. Exact lock released. No merge or audit verdict.
