+N1: Positive conditional energy construction, not universal no-go; no fabricated route quota.
+N2: Prospective contracts and exact failures/corrections retained.
+N3: Actual Hamiltonian/cutoff/full-ground/weak-regime assumptions explicit.
+N4: Forty finite support controls do not prove the analytical theorem or simulate the ground.
+N5: Five literal cost scopes,TOTAL40/22,strict CLI,source SHA,finite JSON,positive180MiB/180s guards. Raw timer began after import; canonical begins before heavy imports, explicitly recorded.
+N6: R>=1,distinct links,full-carrier minimization and nonzero acceptance required.
+N7: No energy inference from norm convergence, no arbitrary path-length uniformity at fixedR.
+N8: Primary and native corrected-root reviews PASS; root native and actual R1 reviews PASS; canonical port review pending.
diff --git a/.claude/science/physics-loops/finite-pw-charged-upper-20260907/NO_GO_LEDGER.md b/.claude/science/physics-loops/finite-pw-charged-upper-20260907/NO_GO_LEDGER.md
